# M6 gate item [1]: openai-python lives in a repo-local venv rather than the
# box's global site-packages, so the gate names its own client version and
# nothing else on this machine changes to run it. Regenerable:
#   python -m venv bench/.venv-openai && bench/.venv-openai/Scripts/pip install openai
bench/.venv-openai/
